todo\n392: \n393: - id: draft-prototype-findings-migration\n394:   title: Verify every prototype-showed finding lives in research-log or is superseded, then delete the section (draft-split)\n395:   kind: build\n396:   needs: []\n397:   soft: [draft-intro-migration, draft-questions-home]\n398:   prio: 4\n399:   status: todo\n400: \n401: - id: draft-str-adr\n402:   title: Record the Str contract as an ADR per the string spike's recommendation, then delete the draft's strings section (draft-split)\n403:   kind: build\n404:   needs: []\n405:   soft: [draft-intro-migration, lines-utf8-edge]\n406:   prio: 3\n407:   status: todo\n408: \n409: - id: draft-mutation-migration\n410:   title: Record the mutation decisions once they land and delete both mutation sections (draft-split)\n411:   kind: build\n412:   needs: [mutation-semantics-design, binary-op-multiplicity-design]\n413:   prio: 4\n414:   status: todo\n415: \n416: - id: binary-op-multiplicity-design\n417:   title: Grill binary operators over multi-valued operands (cartesian, zip, or explicit) and the record-forming update's spelling -- Q2/Q3 (draft-split)\n418:   kind: decide\n419:   needs: []\n420:   prio: 3\n421:   status: todo\n422: \n423: - id: search-and-fold-design\n424:   title: Grill the search vocabulary (choice, cut, .., ordering) and the applicative fold block -- unratified draft sections (draft-split)\n425:   kind: decide\n426:   needs: []\n427:   soft: [first-search-cut]\n428:   prio: 4\n429:   status: todo\n430: \n431: - id: offload-boundary-design\n432:   title: Grill the offload/vectorization thesis -- kernel admissibility, batch invariance, parallel basis, tensors (draft-split)\n433:   kind: decide\n434:   needs: []\n435:   soft: [benchmark-goals]\n436:   prio: 5\n437:   status: todo\n438: \n439: - id: draft-md-cleanup-review\n440:   title: Review what remains of draft.md after every split row lands; assign or delete the remainder, retire the file (draft-split)\n441:   kind: build\n442:   needs: [draf